    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just want to fix me so i can go back to being a productive member of society, but that's the problem. i don't want to be \"fixed\" just to continue this endless, draining cycle. it feels less like life and more like a sentence. sometimes i just look at the concept of nothingness and think... wouldn't that be so much quieter? just a way to finally stop the noise.",
